OL,3,GNEWSAFans face travel delays due to
OL,4,Aurgent gas repairs
OL,5,
OL,6,FFootball fans have been warned of
OL,7,Fdelays to their journeys ahead of
OL,8,FIpswich Town's home game against
OL,9,FLiverpool due to urgent gas works being
OL,10,Fcarried out.
OL,12,FFour-way temporary traffic lights have
OL,13,Fbeen installed at the junction of
OL,14,FBramford Road, Yarmouth Road, and
OL,15,FChevalier Street in Ipswich.
OL,17,FThey were put there on Thursday so
OL,18,Fengineers could repair an "emergency
OL,19,Fgas escape" and are likely to remain in
OL,20,Fsitu until 11 September.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
