OL,3,GNEWSAFans face travel delays due to
OL,4,Aurgent gas repairs
OL,5,
OL,6,FThose heading to Portman Road later `
OL,7,Fbe it by car or public transport ` have
OL,8,Fbeen told to "allow extra time" for
OL,9,Ftheir journeys to ensure they do not
OL,10,Fmiss kick-off.
